 ability to respond and recover and  that's the model that we strive for all  disaster response and recovery should be  locally executed state managed and  federally supported and so we're doing a  lot of work to redesign plans pre-event  contracts not just our pre-event  contracts to support response and  recovery but setting up contracts at all  levels of government to make sure that  we have a full fully capable baseline at  all levels of government to be able to  attack these types of  disaster events Minister Brock long we  appreciate your time thank you so much  thank you
 

